{"id":1438,"date":"2024-12-30T19:26:00","date_gmt":"2024-12-30T19:26:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/?p=1438"},"modified":"2026-08-05T02:08:35","modified_gmt":"2026-08-04T20:08:35","slug":"famm-connect-virtual-launch-event","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/famm-connect-virtual-launch-event\/","title":{"rendered":"Event Recap: Famm Connect Virtual Launch"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p id=\"viewer-86rcp284\">The Famm Connect Launch Party&nbsp;on December 11th wasn\u2019t just an event; it was an incredible moment for the queer community. <strong>Hosted virtually to unite LGBTQ+ professionals and allies from across the globe, it spotlighted the debut of Famm Connect, the groundbreaking social networking app crafted specifically for LGBTQ+ professionals and business owners<\/strong>. And the buzz? It\u2019s still going! Within two weeks of the event, over 500+ people&nbsp;signed up for the app and over 4000+ connections were made, marking it as a pivotal tool for community-building and collaboration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1480\" height=\"1428\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/famm-connect-virtual-launch-party-panel.avif\" alt=\"Promotional graphic for the Famm Connect virtual launch party featuring LGBTQ+ speakers and panel guests.\" class=\"wp-image-1443\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-dokv33409\">A major highlight of the event was the panel discussion, where Blair Imani\u2014creator of &#8220;Smarter In Seconds&#8221; moderated an engaging dialogue. <strong>Joined by Madison Butler&nbsp;of Blue Haired Unicorn, Max Siegel, Director of Trans&amp;, and Spencer Hoddeson&nbsp;of Gay Water, the guests tackled the idea of \u201cprofessionalism\u201d through a queer lens<\/strong>. Their stories and insights deeply resonated, fostering conversations about representation, inclusion, and the power of creating our own spaces.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-zcdsl454\"><strong>Want to check out the event? View the recording <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=PzOTdRmEhf4\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><u>here<\/u><\/strong><\/a><strong>!<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"viewer-ixfoe458\"><strong>For this event I provided the following services<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sponsor Outreach, Onboarding and Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>In-kind\/Giveway Outreach, Onboarding and Management for 14 brands<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Speaker Onboarding and Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Managed Technical Director<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Acted as host and moderator for the event<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ran tech rehearsal + event rehearsals<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Managed assets for event<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1480\" height=\"830\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/famm-connect-virtual-event-attendees.avif\" alt=\"Virtual event attendees joining the Famm Connect launch party online to celebrate LGBTQ+ professional networking and community building.\" class=\"wp-image-1442\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>Just a handful of the 200+ happy attendees!<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-8gkjk806\"><strong>\ud83d\udcf2 <\/strong>So What\u2019s Famm Connect?&nbsp;A new social networking app and vibrant community where LGBTQ+ professionals and business owners can be their authentic selves while building meaningful connections. Created by and for the queer community, Famm Connect&nbsp;empowers you to connect with intention while embracing the intersection of your identity, values, and professional goals. Whether you\u2019re looking to expand your network, build partnerships, discover LGBTQ+-owned businesses, find a mentor, or explore new career opportunities, Famm Connect offers a space for growth and connection.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"viewer-5lzsn808\"><strong>On Famm app you can check out<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Professional Profiles: Showcase your skills, services, and identity proudly.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Community Connections: Build meaningful relationships with others in your industry or find allies to amplify your work.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Resources and Collaboration: Access tools, partnerships, and opportunities tailored to elevate LGBTQ+ professionals.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1480\" height=\"1478\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/famm-connect-lgbtq-networking-app.avif\" alt=\"Mobile app preview for Famm Connect, an LGBTQ+ professional networking platform designed for queer community connection and collaboration.\" class=\"wp-image-1441\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-qadg73635\">Famm Connect&nbsp;is available for free on iOS and Android. If you haven\u2019t signed up yet, now\u2019s the time to get in on the ground floor of a platform that\u2019s reshaping what it means to connect as a professional in our community. To learn more, check out their site at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.heyfamm.com\/famm-connect\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><u>here<\/u><\/strong><\/a><strong>.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/connect\/\">Plan your event with me!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cute Story Events supported the virtual launch of Famm Connect, an LGBTQ+ professional networking app, bringing together queer leaders, speakers, and hundreds of att